	 ('22d1f1b5-f379-4672-88ab-505f7bb9a482','Nike Precision 7','{"title": "", "benefits": ["Low collar provides mobility at the ankle.", "Visible cut-out in the foam helps reduce weight.", "No-sew overlays", "Moulded Swoosh logo", "Colour Shown: White/Black", "Style: FN4322-101", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"], "description": "Score at will at the rim or from deep in the Nike Precision 7. Crafted with a combination of ground control, comfort and on-court traction, it''s perfect for instant impact plays when your name is called for the next casual game. Check in and make the plays that swing the outcome in your favour.", "current_price": "2,069,000₫2,069,000₫2,069,000₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["No-sew overlays", "Moulded Swoosh logo", "Colour Shown: White/Black", "Style: FN4322-101", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/0351925a-de56-4051-92bd-b4e88149e953/NIKE+PRECISION+VII.png',53,294.07,'2024-12-22 15:23:43.126892','2024-12-22 15:23:43.126892','basketball','men'),
