	 ('0e8c8c9f-7216-422e-93d8-9b64d16c4486','Air Jordan XXXVIII Low PF','{"title": "", "benefits": ["Colour Shown: White/Black/Pure Platinum/Metallic Gold", "Style: FD2325-107", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"], "description": "Get grounded, stay grounded. The AJ XXXVIII is all about groundwork—we''re talking about your running, your cutting, your turn-around jumpers—with low-to-the-court cushioning and a secure upper that helps support every move. It''s also designed with sustainability in mind, with at least 20% recycled content by weight. So you can hit ''em with that windscreen-wiper fake and feel good about more than just sinking a bucket for your team.", "current_price": "4,351,199₫4,351,199₫4,351,199₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["Colour Shown: White/Black/Pure Platinum/Metallic Gold", "Style: FD2325-107", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/u_126ab356-44d8-4a06-89b4-fcdcc8df0245,c_scale,fl_relative,w_1.0,h_1.0,fl_layer_apply/51b5cfa9-cd8f-4b28-b600-5569ca19d0eb/AIR+JORDAN+XXXVIII+LOW+PF.png',90,211.31,'2024-12-22 15:23:43.309606','2024-12-22 15:23:43.309606','basketball','men'),
