	 ('be2146b9-d594-4796-8c83-f4b48523a49d','Nike Structure 25','{"title": "", "benefits": ["The breathable engineered mesh upper has targeted zones for support", "A Cushlon 3.0 foam midsole with a Zoom Air unit in the forefoot for cushioning and stability", "A durable Waffle outsole for grip and stability", "A midfoot support system for enhanced arch support to control pronation", "What''s new? The new Cushlon 3.0 foam underfoot and a higher stack height make it our most stable and supportive model yet.", "Weight: Approx. 289g (men''s size 9)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 10mm", "MR-10 Last—Our best, most consistent fit", "Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)", "We softened the materials on the inside of the heel, collar and tongue, so that any part of the shoe that''s touching your ankle feels smooth and comfortable.", "Single-layer mesh provides breathability and durability.", "The durable rubber sole has grooves in the forefoot to create flexibility, and vertical grooves down the side help create stability.", "Cinched-down laces", "Moulded heel", "Weight: 322g (men''s size 9)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 10mm", "Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)", "Colour Shown: Black/Iron Grey/White", "Style: DJ7883-002", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"], "description": "The supportive cushioning provides steadiness for everyday runs. Experience a stable platform without sacrificing performance with a combination of Cushlon 3.0 foam and a Zoom Air unit. Plus, a higher stack height makes it more comfortable, stable and supportive than ever.", "current_price": "3,829,000₫3,829,000₫3,829,000₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["The breathable engineered mesh upper has targeted zones for support", "A Cushlon 3.0 foam midsole with a Zoom Air unit in the forefoot for cushioning and stability", "A durable Waffle outsole for grip and stability", "A midfoot support system for enhanced arch support to control pronation", "What''s new? The new Cushlon 3.0 foam underfoot and a higher stack height make it our most stable and supportive model yet.", "Weight: Approx. 289g (men''s size 9)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 10mm", "MR-10 Last—Our best, most consistent fit", "Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)", "We softened the materials on the inside of the heel, collar and tongue, so that any part of the shoe that''s touching your ankle feels smooth and comfortable.", "Single-layer mesh provides breathability and durability.", "The durable rubber sole has grooves in the forefoot to create flexibility, and vertical grooves down the side help create stability.", "Cinched-down laces", "Moulded heel", "Weight: 322g (men''s size 9)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 10mm", "Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)", "Colour Shown: Black/Iron Grey/White", "Style: DJ7883-002", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/de277aba-3e31-4c0c-b95e-505b000457f5/NIKE+AIR+ZOOM+STRUCTURE+25.png',57,422.26,'2024-12-22 15:28:42.005173','2024-12-22 15:28:42.005173','running','men'),
	 ('69c6fa3c-a462-4287-bd9f-eb914efb2787','Nike Journey Run','{"title": "", "benefits": ["Engineered mesh helps your feet feel secure.", "Extra cushioning in the heel and soft touch points in the tongue and collar add comfort.", "The rubber outsole provides traction for your miles.", "Reflective design details", "Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)", "Colour Shown: White/Wolf Grey/Pure Platinum/Bright Crimson", "Style: FN0228-106", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"], "description": "Enjoy every step, route and jaunt in the Nike Journey Run. It''ll have you striding and smiling on punishing pavements, thanks to an extra-high foam stack and super-soft ComfiRide cushioning. It''s so comfortable that you''ll already be looking forward to lacing ''em up again.", "current_price": "2,649,000₫2,649,000₫2,649,000₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["Reflective design details", "Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)", "Colour Shown: White/Wolf Grey/Pure Platinum/Bright Crimson", "Style: FN0228-106", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/c1993d10-1fb0-404c-9142-561b7cda2fa4/NIKE+JOURNEY+RUN.png',62,429.14,'2024-12-22 15:28:42.006504','2024-12-22 15:28:42.006504','running','men'),
	 ('948b69bd-19a6-4e06-bd48-9813e67a78d1','Nike Pegasus Trail 4','{"title": "", "benefits": ["Weight: Approx. 289g (men''s size 9)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 9.5mm", "Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)", "Colour Shown: Thunder Blue/Chlorophyll/Vapour Green/Light Armoury Blue", "Style: DJ6158-403", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"], "description": "Running is your daily ritual, taking you from road to trail as you seek out new adventures and goals. Let the Nike Pegasus Trail 4 take you there and back again with its supportive and springy feel. Underfoot traction helps keep you going over rocky terrain, while still providing a smooth ride for the road. Midfoot support is controlled by the laces, letting you find the right fit and feel. Your trusted workhorse with wings is ready for an off-road journey. Time to fly. This special design takes you to trail #440 in the Pacific Northwest, one of nature''s playground''s more distinctive gems, as part of our ongoing #IYKYK series.", "current_price": "3,829,000₫3,829,000₫3,829,000₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["Weight: Approx. 289g (men''s size 9)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 9.5mm", "Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)", "Colour Shown: Thunder Blue/Chlorophyll/Vapour Green/Light Armoury Blue", "Style: DJ6158-403", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/e6a98e6b-6727-4b87-aac2-d967eab7a532/NIKE+REACT+PEGASUS+TRAIL+4.png',59,421.64,'2024-12-22 15:28:42.007451','2024-12-22 15:28:42.007451','running','men'),
	 ('1881bd27-8a59-4895-a86a-ba2ab83a1779','Nike Run Swift 3','{"title": "", "benefits": ["Heel overlay for added security", "Mesh by the toe for breathability", "Flex grooves on rugged rubber outsole for flexibility", "Colour Shown: Black/Anthracite/White/Metallic Gold", "Style: DR2695-010", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"], "description": "Whatever the run, the Swift 3 will be there with undying support and devotion. It can help you get out the door for an easy 3 at the end of the day or an intense 2-mile there-and-back with a modified design that''s supportive, durable and all-round comfortable. They''ll help you conquer short distances, sure, but also get you from point A to point B as you navigate the ever-changing rhythms of everyday life.", "current_price": "2,189,000₫2,189,000₫2,189,000₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["Heel overlay for added security", "Mesh by the toe for breathability", "Flex grooves on rugged rubber outsole for flexibility", "Colour Shown: Black/Anthracite/White/Metallic Gold", "Style: DR2695-010", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/b53e7394-ee2d-43b3-8579-1208f26c7d56/NIKE+RUN+SWIFT+3.png',62,276.09,'2024-12-22 15:28:42.008369','2024-12-22 15:28:42.008369','running','men'),
	 ('55fcd62d-7ace-47a1-ace5-c49a7ce252b5','Nike InfinityRN 4','{"title": "", "benefits": ["The updated Flyknit upper and a water-resistant membrane help keep you dry", "New ReactX foam in the midsole for extra cushioning", "A Waffle outsole for durable traction on the roads", "An ultra-comfortable collar and tongue for a soft, snug fit", "What''s new? New ReactX cushioning for even more comfort, and a revamped upper and wider toe box.", "Weight: approx. 354g (men''s size 9)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 9mm", "Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)", "Waffle outsole provides durable traction.", "Flyknit tongue is adjustable and plush.", "Foam collar is soft and supportive to the touch.", "Increased rubber at the outsole gives traction and durability.", "Colour Shown: Black/Team Red/White/Fire Red", "Style: FN0881-007", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"], "description": "Maximum cushioning provides elevated comfort for everyday runs. Experience a soft, rocker-shaped platform made with new ReactX foam underfoot, and an ultra-comfortable collar and tongue for a snug feel. Plus, a water-resistant membrane was added to this version to help keep you dry.", "current_price": "4,699,000₫4,699,000₫4,699,000₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["The updated Flyknit upper and a water-resistant membrane help keep you dry", "New ReactX foam in the midsole for extra cushioning", "A Waffle outsole for durable traction on the roads", "An ultra-comfortable collar and tongue for a soft, snug fit", "What''s new? New ReactX cushioning for even more comfort, and a revamped upper and wider toe box.", "Weight: approx. 354g (men''s size 9)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 9mm", "Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)", "Waffle outsole provides durable traction.", "Flyknit tongue is adjustable and plush.", "Foam collar is soft and supportive to the touch.", "Increased rubber at the outsole gives traction and durability.", "Colour Shown: Black/Team Red/White/Fire Red", "Style: FN0881-007", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/4d9566cd-4520-4b0b-914c-1a7aca4789b4/NIKE+REACTX+INFINITY+RUN+4+W.png',97,279.80,'2024-12-22 15:28:42.009124','2024-12-22 15:28:42.009124','running','men'),
	 ('db4af8fc-e11d-46af-9d83-140a1372a8d2','Nike Juniper Trail 2','{"title": "", "benefits": ["Weight: Approx. 318g (men''s size 9)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 9.5mm", "Foam midsole", "Pull loops", "Colour Shown: Medium Olive/Light Iron Ore/Lilac Bloom/Summit White", "Style: DM0822-200", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"], "description": "Break away from the norm and dash up that tempting trail in the Nike Juniper Trail 2. Durable material on the top and tough traction on the bottom give you a consistent, confident ride for those off-road runs calling your name. It''s built for earthy terrain and unbeaten paths, with reliable traction that''ll help keep you on course.", "current_price": "2,349,000₫2,349,000₫2,349,000₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["Weight: Approx. 318g (men''s size 9)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 9.5mm", "Foam midsole", "Pull loops", "Colour Shown: Medium Olive/Light Iron Ore/Lilac Bloom/Summit White", "Style: DM0822-200", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/bcbf014c-9187-465d-b7e8-3e9e3e252ccf/NIKE+JUNIPER+TRAIL+2+NN.png',83,406.64,'2024-12-22 15:28:42.009868','2024-12-22 15:28:42.009868','running','men'),
	 ('b0c8e0c3-ddc2-4ddd-a7c1-380715305553','Nike Alphafly 3','{"title": "", "benefits": ["Notched laces offer a secure but soft lace-up.", "Integrated knit tongue with lofted padding helps alleviate lace pressure.", "Weight: 218g approx. (men''s UK 9)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 8mm", "Colour Shown: Volt/Dusty Cactus/Total Orange/Concord", "Style: FD8311-700", "Country/Region of Origin: China"], "description": "Fine-tuned for marathon speed, the Alphafly 3 helps push you beyond what you thought possible. Three innovative technologies power your run: a double dose of Air Zoom units helps launch you into your next step; a full-length carbon-fibre plate helps propel you forwards with ease; and a heel-to-toe ZoomX foam midsole helps keep you fresh from start to 26.2. Time to leave your old personal records in the dust.", "current_price": "8,059,000₫8,059,000₫8,059,000₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["Weight: 218g approx. (men''s UK 9)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 8mm", "Colour Shown: Volt/Dusty Cactus/Total Orange/Concord", "Style: FD8311-700", "Country/Region of Origin: China"]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/7776f88c-1bf6-49ac-a53b-b532f4c51a87/AIR+ZOOM+ALPHAFLY+NEXT%25+3.png',93,483.51,'2024-12-22 15:28:42.010566','2024-12-22 15:28:42.010566','running','men'),
	 ('04cd5cb1-d25d-4d71-89f2-c67ca1e2e3cd','Nike React Phantom Run Flyknit 2','{"title": "", "benefits": ["Moulding around the heel keeps you feeling secure so you can focus on your route.", "Increased rubber on the outsole helps deliver better traction and durability.", "Colour Shown: Rough Green/Sequoia/Enamel Green/Yellow Strike", "Style: DX2311-300", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"], "description": "Lightweight, responsive foam and a lace-free design make the Nike React Phantom Run Flyknit 2 the ultimate in comfort for the everyday runner. Flyknit technology in the upper adds secure support while Nike React foam in the midsole helps to cushion your every stride.", "current_price": "4,109,000₫4,109,000₫4,109,000₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["Colour Shown: Rough Green/Sequoia/Enamel Green/Yellow Strike", "Style: DX2311-300", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/5a4abf7c-3b77-48b1-9603-c73b73caf47b/NIKE+REACT+PHANTOM+RUN+FK+2.png',95,293.04,'2024-12-22 15:28:42.019812','2024-12-22 15:28:42.019812','running','men'),
	 ('16561652-47de-403b-a85c-d52d655307fc','Nike Invincible 3','{"title": "", "benefits": ["A breathable Flyknit upper for a secure fit without bulk", "The high and wide ZoomX foam midsole cushions on impact", "A Waffle outsole for durable traction", "Extra cushioning around contact points at the heel and tongue", "What''s new? A wider and taller ZoomX foam midsole for maximum comfort and sleek all-round design updates.", "Weight: approx. 309g (men''s size 9)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 9mm", "Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)", "Colour Shown: Black/Coconut Milk/Bright Crimson/White", "Style: FN1187-001", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"], "description": "Maximum cushioning provides our most comfortable ride for everyday runs. Experience a breathable Flyknit upper and the robust platform of lightweight ZoomX foam that softens impact. Plus, the midsole of this model is wider and taller than the last for even more cushioned comfort.", "current_price": "5,279,000₫5,279,000₫5,279,000₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["A breathable Flyknit upper for a secure fit without bulk", "The high and wide ZoomX foam midsole cushions on impact", "A Waffle outsole for durable traction", "Extra cushioning around contact points at the heel and tongue", "What''s new? A wider and taller ZoomX foam midsole for maximum comfort and sleek all-round design updates.", "Weight: approx. 309g (men''s size 9)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 9mm", "Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)", "Colour Shown: Black/Coconut Milk/Bright Crimson/White", "Style: FN1187-001", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/2c7ec36b-06e3-4734-820b-a78f30bc298a/ZOOMX+INVINCIBLE+RUN+3+WIDE.png',94,348.92,'2024-12-22 15:28:42.011315','2024-12-22 15:28:42.011315','running','men');
INSERT INTO public."PRODUCT" ("PRODUCT_ID","PRODUCT_NAME","PRODUCT_DESCRIPTION","PRODUCT_IMAGE","PRODUCT_QUANTITY","PRODUCT_PRICE","CREATED_AT","UPDATED_AT","PRODUCT_CATEGORY","GENDER") VALUES
	 ('e15ab52b-b4ed-4fd9-a3b4-1b5200a3e551','Nike Vomero 17','{"title": "", "benefits": ["A new engineered mesh upper for soft breathability", "A dual-density midsole with ZoomX foam stacked on top of Cushlon 3.0 foam for a comfortable ride", "A redesigned Waffle-inspired outsole with break points for a smooth, flexible stride", "A plush tongue and lining for a comfortably snug feel", "What''s new? The new stacked foam midsole with premium ZoomX on top of Cushlon 3.0 foam to amplify cushioned comfort.", "Weight: approx. 298g (men''s size 9)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 10mm", "MR-10 Last—Our best, most consistent fit", "Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)", "The high-abrasion rubber with lugs on the outsole gives you durable traction.", "A flexible outsole helps improve your heel-to-toe transition.", "Weight: 300g approx. (Men''s size 9)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 10mm", "Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)", "Colour Shown: Photon Dust/Black/Platinum Tint/Hyper Punch", "Style: FB1309-008", "Country/Region of Origin: China"], "description": "Maximum cushioning provides a comfortable ride for everyday runs. Experience enhanced comfort in this latest version, with a dual-density midsole made with a combination of ZoomX underfoot and Cushlon 3.0 foam throughout. Plus, a new engineered mesh upper offers more breathability.", "current_price": "4,699,000₫4,699,000₫4,699,000₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["A new engineered mesh upper for soft breathability", "A dual-density midsole with ZoomX foam stacked on top of Cushlon 3.0 foam for a comfortable ride", "A redesigned Waffle-inspired outsole with break points for a smooth, flexible stride", "A plush tongue and lining for a comfortably snug feel", "What''s new? The new stacked foam midsole with premium ZoomX on top of Cushlon 3.0 foam to amplify cushioned comfort.", "Weight: approx. 298g (men''s size 9)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 10mm", "MR-10 Last—Our best, most consistent fit", "Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)", "The high-abrasion rubber with lugs on the outsole gives you durable traction.", "A flexible outsole helps improve your heel-to-toe transition.", "Weight: 300g approx. (Men''s size 9)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 10mm", "Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)", "Colour Shown: Photon Dust/Black/Platinum Tint/Hyper Punch", "Style: FB1309-008", "Country/Region of Origin: China"]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/eefebb62-5e8b-4037-beaa-1701aa75fbb0/NIKE+VOMERO+17.png',62,307.51,'2024-12-22 15:28:42.012007','2024-12-22 15:28:42.012007','running','men'),
	 ('663b7da5-d706-4c6b-b149-e0dfa4d1b1d4','Nike Pegasus 41 PRM','{"title": "", "benefits": ["Upgraded breathable engineered mesh upper", "ReactX foam midsole surrounds forefoot and heel Air Zoom units for an energised ride.", "Signature waffle-inspired rubber outsole for traction and flexibility", "A plush collar, tongue and sockliner for a secure and comfortable fit", "What''s new? All-new ReactX foam midsole is 13% more responsive than previous React technology.", "Crafted for performance and planet, ReactX foam is engineered to reduce its carbon footprint by at least 43% in a pair of midsoles due to reduced manufacturing process energy compared with prior React foam. The carbon footprint of ReactX is based on cradle-to-gate assessment reviewed by PRé Sustainability B.V. and Intertek China. Other midsole components such as airbags, plates or other foam formulations were not considered.", "Reflective design Swoosh logo, overlays and laces", "Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)", "Weight: approx. 297g (men''s size 9)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 10mm", "MR-10 last—our best, most consistent fit (same as Pegasus 40)", "Colour Shown: Hyper Crimson/Safety Orange/Photon Dust/Metallic Silver", "Style: HQ2938-800", "Country/Region of Origin: China"], "description": "Responsive cushioning in the winterized Pegasus provides an energised ride for everyday road running, day or night. Experience lighter-weight energy return with dual Air Zoom units and a ReactX foam midsole. Plus, reflective design paint on the upper lights up your route.", "current_price": "4,109,000₫4,109,000₫4,109,000₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["Upgraded breathable engineered mesh upper", "ReactX foam midsole surrounds forefoot and heel Air Zoom units for an energised ride.", "Signature waffle-inspired rubber outsole for traction and flexibility", "A plush collar, tongue and sockliner for a secure and comfortable fit", "What''s new? All-new ReactX foam midsole is 13% more responsive than previous React technology.", "Crafted for performance and planet, ReactX foam is engineered to reduce its carbon footprint by at least 43% in a pair of midsoles due to reduced manufacturing process energy compared with prior React foam. The carbon footprint of ReactX is based on cradle-to-gate assessment reviewed by PRé Sustainability B.V. and Intertek China. Other midsole components such as airbags, plates or other foam formulations were not considered.", "Reflective design Swoosh logo, overlays and laces", "Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)", "Weight: approx. 297g (men''s size 9)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 10mm", "MR-10 last—our best, most consistent fit (same as Pegasus 40)", "Colour Shown: Hyper Crimson/Safety Orange/Photon Dust/Metallic Silver", "Style: HQ2938-800", "Country/Region of Origin: China"]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/5e3b020e-ab24-496b-b17c-ab25a03516ff/AIR+ZOOM+PEGASUS+41+PRM.png',73,468.62,'2024-12-22 15:28:42.01279','2024-12-22 15:28:42.01279','running','men'),
