	 ('8ba8f716-e87d-422d-bddf-6914f27b89f2','LeBron XXI EP','{"title": "", "benefits": ["Colour Shown: Cool Grey/Iron Grey/Wolf Grey/Metallic Silver", "Style: HF5352-001", "Country/Region of Origin: China"], "description": "Last time around, LeBron flipped the script on his shoe game as only the King can. The encore is even better. The LeBron XXI has a cabling system that works with an Air Zoom unit and a light, low-to-the-ground design, giving you agile fluidity and explosiveness without excess weight. Created for your ascent and the next generation of hoopers, it''s ideal for Bron-like open-floor attacks and rising towards the rim when the game''s pace turns up. This rugged design encourages you to keep going even when things get difficult. With its extra-durable rubber outsole, this version gives you traction for outdoor courts.", "current_price": "4,695,199₫4,695,199₫4,695,199₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["Colour Shown: Cool Grey/Iron Grey/Wolf Grey/Metallic Silver", "Style: HF5352-001", "Country/Region of Origin: China"]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/942b7c56-c452-4b2f-a3b8-227efebfb259/LEBRON+XXI+EP.png',55,383.95,'2024-12-22 15:29:13.050561','2024-12-22 15:29:13.050561','basketball','women'),
	 ('8d40601d-5ef8-456a-a82c-e3a7367b7477','Cosmic Unity 3','{"title": "", "benefits": ["Colour Shown: Football Grey/Ashen Slate/Light Carbon/White", "Style: DV2757-006", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"], "description": "Better for your game, designed with sustainability in mind—two things you care about—the Cosmic Unity 3 has a secure, lightweight design for a low-to-the-ground feel. It gives you cloud-like cushioning for explosive speed and quick changes of direction, the difference-makers in a game that''s becoming more extraterrestrial.", "current_price": "2,865,849₫2,865,849₫2,865,849₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["Colour Shown: Football Grey/Ashen Slate/Light Carbon/White", "Style: DV2757-006", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/2f98689d-ddf7-4c59-9986-93c39849f571/COSMIC+UNITY+3.png',78,480.57,'2024-12-22 15:29:13.051269','2024-12-22 15:29:13.051269','basketball','women'),
	 ('71314de6-99ef-462c-82ba-b86b6533cd69','Freak 5 EP','{"title": "", "benefits": ["Colour Shown: Soft Yellow/White/Light Laser Orange/Light Photo Blue", "Style: DX4996-700", "Country/Region of Origin: China"], "description": "Giannis''s internal engine revs from deep within, requiring a shoe that can harness his superpower abilities. Enter the Freak 5. Stacked with stunning speed for super-quick first steps, stuffed with that sort of springy cushioning that can withstand the all-game grind, his signature shoe lets you feel like the Greek Freak. Blow past your opponent en route to the rim while sticking with quick-twitch ball-handlers when a defensive stand decides the game. With its extra-durable rubber outsole, this version gives you traction for outdoor courts.", "current_price": "2,201,399₫2,201,399₫2,201,399₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["Colour Shown: Soft Yellow/White/Light Laser Orange/Light Photo Blue", "Style: DX4996-700", "Country/Region of Origin: China"]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/dd65ccf4-3a1d-4f06-9a25-bb0700bccfd3/ZOOM+FREAK+5+EP.png',98,392.51,'2024-12-22 15:29:13.051929','2024-12-22 15:29:13.051929','basketball','women'),
	 ('48ac002f-3029-48b9-965f-1b9637ba6fde','Freak 5 EP','{"title": "", "benefits": ["Colour Shown: Photo Blue/Metallic Silver/Barely Volt/Black", "Style: DX4996-402", "Country/Region of Origin: China"], "description": "Giannis''s internal engine revs from deep within, requiring a shoe that can harness his superpower abilities. Enter the Freak 5. Stacked with stunning speed for super-quick first steps, stuffed with that sort of springy cushioning that can withstand the all-game grind, his signature shoe lets you feel like the Greek Freak. Blow past your opponent en route to the rim while sticking with quick-twitch ball-handlers when a defensive stand decides the game. With its extra-durable rubber outsole, this version gives you traction for outdoor courts.", "current_price": "2,201,399₫2,201,399₫2,201,399₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["Colour Shown: Photo Blue/Metallic Silver/Barely Volt/Black", "Style: DX4996-402", "Country/Region of Origin: China"]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/09944226-d44e-4165-b12c-8067163414d9/ZOOM+FREAK+5+EP.png',77,494.06,'2024-12-22 15:29:13.052767','2024-12-22 15:29:13.052767','basketball','women'),
	 ('519020c5-38db-4812-a425-3f70ae024ab5','Nike G.T. Hustle 2 EP','{"title": "", "benefits": ["Foam tongue helps reduce lace pressure.", "The Waffle herringbone traction pattern offers great bite and court feel.", "Colour Shown: White/Malachite/Pure Platinum/Vintage Green", "Style: DJ9404-103", "Country/Region of Origin: China"], "description": "One step can make all the difference when it''s game point, like a sneaky successful back-door layup that''s blocked if not for a sliver of separation, or a last-second leap at your opponent that sends their 3 clanking off the rim. We used insights from female athletes to make the G.T. Hustle 2 soft, supportive and lightweight—which every basketball player needs. Loaded with cushioning in the core and Zoom Air, this shoe helps you stay moving forwards—from check-up to \"that''s game\". Sprint, stop and score from end to end, focusing on dominating, not deteriorating, down the stretch. With its extra-durable rubber outsole, this version gives you traction for outdoor courts.", "current_price": "3,249,349₫3,249,349₫3,249,349₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["Colour Shown: White/Malachite/Pure Platinum/Vintage Green", "Style: DJ9404-103", "Country/Region of Origin: China"]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/a8108cf1-7c04-466f-a1e1-6c63dd5511ae/AIR+ZOOM+G.T.+HUSTLE+2+EP.png',89,482.71,'2024-12-22 15:29:13.053601','2024-12-22 15:29:13.053601','basketball','women'),
	 ('2ed3dd98-5add-4451-819f-471886325a0a','Nike G.T. Jump 2 EP ''Shaedon Sharpe''','{"title": "", "benefits": ["Colour Shown: Multi-Colour/Multi-Colour/Multi-Colour", "Style: HJ6626-900", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"], "description": "Shaedon Sharpe will posterise a poor defender yet head back on defence without so much as a shrug. This special G.T. Jump 2 celebrates the high-flying, humble Canadian, taking its cues from his country''s origins and the team that picked him. Show off your bounce with three Air Zoom units that offer next-level, Shaedon-like springiness. Nike React foam helps cushion the landing once you''ve come down from the clouds and helps keep you fresh as you get ready for lift-off once again. See you at the rim. With its extra-durable rubber outsole, this version gives you traction for outdoor courts.", "current_price": "4,471,199₫4,471,199₫4,471,199₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["Colour Shown: Multi-Colour/Multi-Colour/Multi-Colour", "Style: HJ6626-900", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/5eca86b4-76e4-4345-84f8-64aaa5cc222e/AIR+ZOOM++G.T.+JUMP+2+EP+SS.png',55,372.05,'2024-12-22 15:29:13.054402','2024-12-22 15:29:13.054402','basketball','women'),
	 ('b891ad0e-b4a2-4c68-b1f8-d86254f6c122','Nike G.T. Hustle 3 EP','{"title": "", "benefits": ["Colour Shown: Laser Orange/Metallic Silver/Vast Grey/Black", "Style: FV5952-800", "Country/Region of Origin: China"], "description": "The G.T. Hustle 3 can help you thrive at crunch time. With double-stacked Air Zoom cushioning providing bouncy horsepower, it helps save you energy over the course of the game. It''s designed for those who want to outlast their opponent and stay fresh through to the final buzzer. Who''s got next? You do. With its extra-durable rubber outsole, this version gives you traction for outdoor courts.", "current_price": "5,589,000₫5,589,000₫5,589,000₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["Colour Shown: Laser Orange/Metallic Silver/Vast Grey/Black", "Style: FV5952-800", "Country/Region of Origin: China"]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/e098020d-e7af-42dc-bd73-9758b3a93ee2/G.T.+HUSTLE+3+EP.png',84,344.45,'2024-12-22 15:29:13.055247','2024-12-22 15:29:13.055247','basketball','women'),
	 ('32e023bf-bbf8-4f35-9e25-bff1b1feeefd','Nike G.T. Hustle 3 EP','{"title": "", "benefits": ["Colour Shown: Pure Platinum/White/Light Lemon Twist/Glacier Blue", "Style: FV5952-004", "Country/Region of Origin: China"], "description": "The G.T. Hustle 3 can help you thrive at crunch time. With double-stacked Air Zoom cushioning providing bouncy horsepower, it helps save you energy over the course of the game. It''s designed for those who want to outlast their opponent and stay fresh through to the final buzzer. Who''s got next? You do. With its extra-durable rubber outsole, this version gives you traction for outdoor courts.", "current_price": "5,589,000₫5,589,000₫5,589,000₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["Colour Shown: Pure Platinum/White/Light Lemon Twist/Glacier Blue", "Style: FV5952-004", "Country/Region of Origin: China"]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/ac823a51-3c20-4939-8f8d-facf254f87f3/G.T.+HUSTLE+3+EP.png',84,495.43,'2024-12-22 15:29:13.056621','2024-12-22 15:29:13.056621','basketball','women'),
	 ('d721ff2e-ca2a-4f50-8606-886cb96b1f43','Nike G.T. Cut 3','{"title": "", "benefits": ["The stretchy, breathable material up top is super lightweight and helps keep you cool.", "The padded collar at the Achilles helps your ankle feel comfortable, yet secure.", "Colour Shown: Sail/Light Khaki/University Red/Ironstone", "Style: HV5977-102", "Country/Region of Origin: China"], "description": "How can you separate your game when it''s winning time? Start by lacing up in the G.T. Cut 3. Designed to help you create space for stepback jumpers and backdoor cuts, its sticky multi-court traction helps you stop in an instant and shift gears at will. And when you''re making all those game-changing plays, the newly added, ultra-responsive ZoomX foam helps keep you fresh for all four quarters.", "current_price": "5,589,000₫5,589,000₫5,589,000₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["Colour Shown: Sail/Light Khaki/University Red/Ironstone", "Style: HV5977-102", "Country/Region of Origin: China"]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/4fad10e6-aa4e-4ebc-a95b-94f97b090ed8/G.T.+CUT+3+EP.png',89,469.37,'2024-12-22 15:29:13.057321','2024-12-22 15:29:13.057321','basketball','women'),
	 ('ac8b19df-d40c-4a1c-a61e-708bfd09303a','Nike Mercurial Vapor 16 Academy','{"title": "", "benefits": ["For use on shorter, synthetic surfaces", "Cushioned insole", "Colour Shown: Black/Deep Jungle/Black", "Style: FQ8449-002", "Country/Region of Origin: Indonesia"], "description": "Looking to take your speed to the next level? We made these Academy Shoes with an improved heel Air Zoom unit. It gives you the propulsive feel needed to break through the back line. The result is the most responsive Mercurial we''ve ever made, so you can dictate pace and tempo all match long.", "current_price": "2,479,000₫2,479,000₫2,479,000₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["For use on shorter, synthetic surfaces", "Cushioned insole", "Colour Shown: Black/Deep Jungle/Black", "Style: FQ8449-002", "Country/Region of Origin: Indonesia"]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/93ca7a3c-9f8c-4278-bb3e-97fd11e3dd40/ZOOM+VAPOR+16+ACADEMY+TF.png',74,466.75,'2024-12-22 15:29:24.445694','2024-12-22 15:29:24.445694','football','women');
INSERT INTO public."PRODUCT" ("PRODUCT_ID","PRODUCT_NAME","PRODUCT_DESCRIPTION","PRODUCT_IMAGE","PRODUCT_QUANTITY","PRODUCT_PRICE","CREATED_AT","UPDATED_AT","PRODUCT_CATEGORY","GENDER") VALUES
	 ('0f9e86de-81a2-417d-bfbe-22c4430a2617','Nike G.T. Jump Academy EP','{"title": "", "benefits": ["The two stacked midsole foams provide a cushioned landing after take-off.", "The tall height and shape of the collar give you extra coverage and support when jumping high and often.", "The carved heel helps cushion your landing once you''ve gone skywards.", "The durable rubber outsole wraps around the sides of the forefoot for added stability and durability.", "The textured upper is structured and stable, yet soft and breathable.", "Colour Shown: Black/Green Strike/White", "Style: HF1804-001", "Country/Region of Origin: Indonesia"], "description": "The spring-loaded G.T. Jump Academy helps cushion your landing from skying for those boards. With a pair of soft foams stacked on top of each other and a curved heel, you can leap and land with confidence on any court. With its extra-durable rubber outsole, this version gives you traction for outdoor courts.", "current_price": "2,349,000₫2,349,000₫2,349,000₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["Colour Shown: Black/Green Strike/White", "Style: HF1804-001", "Country/Region of Origin: Indonesia"]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/7a5c94d7-719e-47bb-b908-4b4ba2e3808e/G.T.+JUMP+ACADEMY+EP.png',80,428.10,'2024-12-22 15:29:13.058029','2024-12-22 15:29:13.058029','basketball','women'),
	 ('5f80f671-f0f4-44f1-9cfe-a3e395aea2bd','Nike Precision 7','{"title": "", "benefits": ["Low collar provides mobility at the ankle.", "Visible cut-out in the foam helps reduce weight.", "No-sew overlays", "Moulded Swoosh logo", "Colour Shown: White/Black", "Style: FN4322-101", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"], "description": "Score at will at the rim or from deep in the Nike Precision 7. Crafted with a combination of ground control, comfort and on-court traction, it''s perfect for instant impact plays when your name is called for the next casual game. Check in and make the plays that swing the outcome in your favour.", "current_price": "2,069,000₫2,069,000₫2,069,000₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["No-sew overlays", "Moulded Swoosh logo", "Colour Shown: White/Black", "Style: FN4322-101", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/0351925a-de56-4051-92bd-b4e88149e953/NIKE+PRECISION+VII.png',55,487.11,'2024-12-22 15:29:13.059346','2024-12-22 15:29:13.059346','basketball','women'),
	 ('9fc1ec2a-5cf4-4cef-b43f-92761d2e8209','Nike G.T. Cut Academy EP','{"title": "", "benefits": ["Colour Shown: Iron Grey/Baltic Blue/Football Grey", "Style: FB2598-006", "Country/Region of Origin: China"], "description": "Whether you''re playing in the gym, at the park or on your driveway, lace up in the all-new G.T. Cut Academy. Designed to help you create space for step-back jumpers, back-door cuts and other game-changing plays, its sticky multi-court traction helps you stop in an instant and shift gears at will—wherever your next game is calling you. With its extra-durable rubber outsole, this version gives you traction for outdoor courts.", "current_price": "2,649,000₫2,649,000₫2,649,000₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["Colour Shown: Iron Grey/Baltic Blue/Football Grey", "Style: FB2598-006", "Country/Region of Origin: China"]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/4232359e-b195-4ca1-84d8-ae8ba77e81fd/AIR+ZOOM+G.T.+CUT+ACADEMY+EP.png',61,238.79,'2024-12-22 15:29:13.059961','2024-12-22 15:29:13.059961','basketball','women'),
	 ('958693af-feea-4e42-8ae8-9deccd70631d','Nike G.T. Cut Academy EP','{"title": "", "benefits": ["Colour Shown: White/Sport Red/Obsidian", "Style: FB2598-104", "Country/Region of Origin: China"], "description": "Whether you''re playing in the gym, at the park or on your driveway, lace up in the all-new G.T. Cut Academy. Designed to help you create space for step-back jumpers, back-door cuts and other game-changing plays, its sticky multi-court traction helps you stop in an instant and shift gears at will—wherever your next game is calling you. With its extra-durable rubber outsole, this version gives you traction for outdoor courts.", "current_price": "2,649,000₫2,649,000₫2,649,000₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["Colour Shown: White/Sport Red/Obsidian", "Style: FB2598-104", "Country/Region of Origin: China"]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/4cb0ba51-088a-47d7-a221-f210cde03674/AIR+ZOOM+G.T.+CUT+ACADEMY+EP.png',87,491.36,'2024-12-22 15:29:13.060686','2024-12-22 15:29:13.060686','basketball','women'),
	 ('0d559dfd-9b8a-4e07-8741-a02d7940b7fa','Book 1 EP','{"title": "", "benefits": ["Colour Shown: White/Burnt Sunrise/Black/Light Orewood Brown", "Style: FJ4250-101", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"], "description": "Devin Booker is a craftsman who can lose a defender with an ankle-snatching \"stutter/go\", then come back with a series of spellbinding jabs into a splashed jumper. Book''s signature shoe gives him the tools he needs to carve. With leather accents highlighting a super-smooth upper and a speedy, cushioned ride, this design can help you explore the spaces created by your footwork and hungry-hooper soul. With its extra-durable rubber outsole, this version gives you traction for outdoor courts.", "current_price": "4,109,000₫4,109,000₫4,109,000₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["Colour Shown: White/Burnt Sunrise/Black/Light Orewood Brown", "Style: FJ4250-101", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/a28864e3-de02-48bb-b861-9c592bc9a68b/BOOK+1+EP.png',60,466.11,'2024-12-22 15:29:13.061362','2024-12-22 15:29:13.061362','basketball','women'),
	 ('bf4848a5-e5dc-4227-8999-ea191b23125a','G.T. Hustle Academy EP','{"title": "", "benefits": ["Colour Shown: Black/Black", "Style: FJ7808-001", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"], "description": "The G.T. Hustle Academy helps keep you fast, wherever your next game is. A full Flyknit upper works with responsive foams to help you feel fresh on the court. With its extra-durable rubber outsole, this version gives you traction for outdoor courts.", "current_price": "2,649,000₫2,649,000₫2,649,000₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["Colour Shown: Black/Black", "Style: FJ7808-001", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/3ce53421-8cb6-4a7f-951a-de60c609dfe9/G.T.+HUSTLE+ACADEMY+EP.png',91,462.05,'2024-12-22 15:29:13.062148','2024-12-22 15:29:13.062148','basketball','women'),
	 ('ce3a6dcb-2149-4af1-82cc-7342afa9aee1','LeBron NXXT Gen AMPD EP','{"title": "", "benefits": ["Colour Shown: Black/University Red/Metallic Gold", "Style: FJ1567-001", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"], "description": "Whether you''re a dunk-competition-like leaper or a below-the-rim wonder roaming the baseline, feel fast, low to the court and assured in the LeBron NXXT Gen. We tailored specifically it to meet the demands of today''s fast-paced game so that you can stay ahead of the opposition with your speed in all directions. With its extra-durable rubber outsole, this version gives you traction for outdoor courts.", "current_price": "4,699,000₫4,699,000₫4,699,000₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["Colour Shown: Black/University Red/Metallic Gold", "Style: FJ1567-001", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/0a1ad373-cfe3-4569-a730-16eb9e1783ae/ZM+LEBRON+NXXT+GEN+AMPD+EP.png',56,396.63,'2024-12-22 15:29:13.062815','2024-12-22 15:29:13.062815','basketball','women'),
	 ('5094f3d7-84c8-432f-b022-a8b6db908d1b','Nike G.T. Cut Academy EP','{"title": "", "benefits": ["Colour Shown: Sea Glass/Olive Aura/Light Wild Mango/Oil Green", "Style: FB2598-007", "Country/Region of Origin: China"], "description": "Whether you''re playing in the gym, at the park or on your driveway, lace up in the all-new G.T. Cut Academy. Designed to help you create space for step-back jumpers, back-door cuts and other game-changing plays, its sticky multi-court traction helps you stop in an instant and shift gears at will—wherever your next game is calling you. With its extra-durable rubber outsole, this version gives you traction for outdoor courts.", "current_price": "2,649,000₫2,649,000₫2,649,000₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["Colour Shown: Sea Glass/Olive Aura/Light Wild Mango/Oil Green", "Style: FB2598-007", "Country/Region of Origin: China"]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/6d8cea8c-e169-4a94-b7a5-4202bbaa89ba/AIR+ZOOM+G.T.+CUT+ACADEMY+EP.png',61,429.54,'2024-12-22 15:29:13.063582','2024-12-22 15:29:13.063582','basketball','women'),
	 ('9254237c-c6a4-4b2b-ac3d-1131898e3399','G.T. Hustle Academy EP','{"title": "", "benefits": ["Colour Shown: Vintage Green/Stadium Green/Jade Horizon/Sail", "Style: FJ7808-300", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"], "description": "The G.T. Hustle Academy helps keep you fast, wherever your next game is. A full Flyknit upper works with responsive foams to help you feel fresh on the court. With its extra-durable rubber outsole, this version gives you traction for outdoor courts.", "current_price": "2,649,000₫2,649,000₫2,649,000₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["Colour Shown: Vintage Green/Stadium Green/Jade Horizon/Sail", "Style: FJ7808-300", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/76da042c-22d0-463b-9551-ce0e87059482/G.T.+HUSTLE+ACADEMY+EP.png',73,478.18,'2024-12-22 15:29:13.064328','2024-12-22 15:29:13.064328','basketball','women'),
	 ('383e6712-6d47-46c0-8c04-a4ee2009450a','KD17 EP','{"title": "", "benefits": ["Colour Shown: Light Iron Ore/Black/Sail/Metallic Gold", "Style: FJ9488-003", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"], "description": "While Kevin Durant''s all-timer status is already cemented, his hooper soul can''t be soothed unless he''s on the court, perfecting his craft. Put in the work to be great in the KD17, a shoe for gym rats and those who insist on running it back. A forefoot Air Zoom unit enhances your first step. We combined it with Nike Air cushioning to fuel full-court sprints and defensive stops that can decide games. With its extra-durable rubber outsole, this version gives you traction for outdoor courts.", "current_price": "4,409,000₫4,409,000₫4,409,000₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["Colour Shown: Light Iron Ore/Black/Sail/Metallic Gold", "Style: FJ9488-003", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/bd5a1c0e-7926-4aa7-b71c-f1132359fe6b/KD17+EP.png',89,489.69,'2024-12-22 15:29:13.065047','2024-12-22 15:29:13.065047','basketball','women');
INSERT INTO public."PRODUCT" ("PRODUCT_ID","PRODUCT_NAME","PRODUCT_DESCRIPTION","PRODUCT_IMAGE","PRODUCT_QUANTITY","PRODUCT_PRICE","CREATED_AT","UPDATED_AT","PRODUCT_CATEGORY","GENDER") VALUES
	 ('fa6e847e-b9c6-4dcc-a4ce-38039d0c163a','Nike Precision 7','{"title": "", "benefits": ["Low collar provides mobility at the ankle.", "Visible cut-out in the foam helps reduce weight.", "No-sew overlays", "Moulded Swoosh logo", "Colour Shown: Total Orange/Laser Orange/Photon Dust/Black", "Style: FN4322-800", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"], "description": "Score at will at the rim or from deep in the Nike Precision 7. Crafted with a combination of ground control, comfort and on-court traction, it''s perfect for instant impact plays when your name is called for the next casual game. Check in and make the plays that swing the outcome in your favour.", "current_price": "2,069,000₫2,069,000₫2,069,000₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["No-sew overlays", "Moulded Swoosh logo", "Colour Shown: Total Orange/Laser Orange/Photon Dust/Black", "Style: FN4322-800", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/3851856e-aa29-438d-9f49-048a7828663a/NIKE+PRECISION+VII.png',79,440.25,'2024-12-22 15:29:13.065782','2024-12-22 15:29:13.065782','basketball','women'),
	 ('46994b52-072a-43ef-a074-3e4986360903','Giannis Immortality 4 ''Christmas'' EP','{"title": "", "benefits": ["Colour Shown: Dusty Cactus/Royal Pulse/Green Frost/White", "Style: FQ3681-300", "Country/Region of Origin: China"], "description": "The Giannis Immortality 4 is for the multi-faceted player. The sleek, supportive heel shape is combined with an upgraded traction pattern from the previous iteration to help keep you making all those game-changing plays. With its extra-durable rubber outsole, this version gives you traction for outdoor courts. This winter-themed design pays homage to Giannis''s cold-blooded status, whatever the season.", "current_price": "2,349,000₫2,349,000₫2,349,000₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["Colour Shown: Dusty Cactus/Royal Pulse/Green Frost/White", "Style: FQ3681-300", "Country/Region of Origin: China"]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/51b03fda-9fa3-4c53-8137-673b2d15e2d0/GIANNIS+IMMORTALITY+4+EP.png',89,338.49,'2024-12-22 15:29:13.066499','2024-12-22 15:29:13.066499','basketball','women'),
	 ('7b22eddf-0e38-4fc7-85e6-e21643b9327b','Nike G.T. Hustle 3 ''Paige Bueckers'' EP','{"title": "", "benefits": ["Colour Shown: Multi-Colour/Multi-Colour/Multi-Colour", "Style: HJ7677-900", "Country/Region of Origin: China"], "description": "The G.T. Hustle 3 can help you thrive at crunch time. With double-stacked Air Zoom cushioning providing bouncy horsepower, it helps save you energy over the course of the game. It''s designed for those who want to outlast their opponent and stay fresh through to the final buzzer. This special design pays homage to Paige Bueckers'' hometowns and her penchant for getting buckets. With its extra-durable rubber outsole, this version gives you traction for outdoor courts.", "current_price": "5,589,000₫5,589,000₫5,589,000₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["Colour Shown: Multi-Colour/Multi-Colour/Multi-Colour", "Style: HJ7677-900", "Country/Region of Origin: China"]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/c9d49088-c3d3-4a8a-8ffe-881810c54a33/G.T.+HUSTLE+3++PB+EP.png',57,473.32,'2024-12-22 15:29:13.067216','2024-12-22 15:29:13.067216','basketball','women'),
	 ('8282e079-b1ff-4b65-9315-44159ac5e3e8','KD17 ''Aunt Pearl'' EP','{"title": "", "benefits": ["Colour Shown: Pink Foam/Beyond Pink", "Style: FZ1519-600", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"], "description": "While Kevin Durant''s all-timer status is already cemented, his hooper soul can''t be soothed unless he''s on the court, perfecting his craft. Put in the work to be great in the KD17, a shoe for gym rats and those who insist on running it back. A forefoot Air Zoom unit enhances your first step. We combined it with Nike Air cushioning to fuel full-court sprints and defensive stops that can decide games. This special all-pink design honours KD''s aunt who passed away from lung cancer in 2000, but inspires us all to continue to fight to find a cure. With its extra-durable rubber outsole, this version gives you traction for outdoor courts.", "current_price": "4,699,000₫4,699,000₫4,699,000₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["Colour Shown: Pink Foam/Beyond Pink", "Style: FZ1519-600", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/775f50f9-3ce9-437d-889d-6ebb383af578/KD17+NRG+EP.png',62,439.89,'2024-12-22 15:29:13.068157','2024-12-22 15:29:13.068157','basketball','women'),
	 ('c732c41c-6b57-4d19-8125-0ec151e965f9','Book 1 EP ''Sunset''','{"title": "", "benefits": ["Colour Shown: Court Purple/Taupe Grey/Sundial/Total Orange", "Style: HJ5355-500", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"], "description": "Devin Booker is a craftsman who can lose a defender with an ankle-snatching \"stutter/go\", then come back with a series of spellbinding jabs into a splashed jumper. Book''s signature shoe gives him the tools he needs to carve. With a super-smooth upper and speedy, cushioned ride, this design can help you explore the spaces created by your piercing footwork and hungry hooper soul. With its extra-durable rubber outsole, this version gives you traction for outdoor courts. This multi-coloured masterpiece takes its inspiration from the legendary, late-night desert sunsets where Book calls home.", "current_price": "4,109,000₫4,109,000₫4,109,000₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["Colour Shown: Court Purple/Taupe Grey/Sundial/Total Orange", "Style: HJ5355-500", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/af93f1da-52bb-47cf-b4dc-f7228771a9b9/BOOK+1+EP.png',56,347.70,'2024-12-22 15:29:13.068924','2024-12-22 15:29:13.068924','basketball','women'),
	 ('4f7ffa55-4a7b-4e4b-b24f-7a8c5e5d9e52','Nike Precision 7','{"title": "", "benefits": ["Low collar provides mobility at the ankle.", "Visible cut-out in the foam helps reduce weight.", "No-sew overlays", "Moulded Swoosh logo", "Colour Shown: Smoke Grey/Iron Grey/Hot Punch/Photon Dust", "Style: FN4322-003", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"], "description": "Score at will at the rim or from deep in the Nike Precision 7. Crafted with a combination of ground control, comfort and on-court traction, it''s perfect for instant impact plays when your name is called for the next casual game. Check in and make the plays that swing the outcome in your favour.", "current_price": "2,069,000₫2,069,000₫2,069,000₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["No-sew overlays", "Moulded Swoosh logo", "Colour Shown: Smoke Grey/Iron Grey/Hot Punch/Photon Dust", "Style: FN4322-003", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/43aad5f0-7d09-49f6-999d-8f6dd61f4d6a/NIKE+PRECISION+VII.png',83,206.68,'2024-12-22 15:29:13.069585','2024-12-22 15:29:13.069585','basketball','women'),
	 ('b02e060e-eb7d-40be-9f38-bda58ef03774','Nike G.T. Cut 3 EP','{"title": "", "benefits": ["The stretchy, breathable material up top is super lightweight and helps keep you cool.", "The padded collar at the Achilles helps your ankle feel comfortable, yet secure.", "Colour Shown: Royal Pulse/Light Wild Mango/Plum Dust/Sail", "Style: DV2918-403", "Country/Region of Origin: China"], "description": "How can you separate your game when it''s winning time? Start by lacing up in the G.T. Cut 3. Designed to help you create space for stepback jumpers and backdoor cuts, its sticky multi-court traction helps you stop in an instant and shift gears at will. And when you''re making all those game-changing plays, the newly added, ultra-responsive ZoomX foam helps keep you fresh for all four quarters. With its extra-durable rubber outsole, this version gives you traction for outdoor courts.", "current_price": "5,589,000₫5,589,000₫5,589,000₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["Colour Shown: Royal Pulse/Light Wild Mango/Plum Dust/Sail", "Style: DV2918-403", "Country/Region of Origin: China"]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/00a21b30-a076-4f51-b9fd-09f03212e735/G.T.+CUT+3+EP.png',60,206.93,'2024-12-22 15:29:13.070364','2024-12-22 15:29:13.070364','basketball','women'),
	 ('9ff7d8b6-fc10-43ea-adbe-f403268ba616','Jordan Heir Series PF Showstopper''','{"title": "", "benefits": ["Lightweight textiles in the upper help keep things breathable and comfortable.", "Synthetic leather in the upper helps add durability.", "The PF edition is designed with a wider fit and optimised for play on outdoor courts.", "Pull tab on heel", "Rubber outsole", "Colour Shown: Sail/Vapour Green/Black", "Style: FZ2473-100", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"], "description": "Looking to ignite your competitive edge? Cue the Jordan Heir. Crafted with insights from women basketball players, these shoes are all about helping you play shifty and stay low to the ground. A drop-in midsole helps give you extra mobility, while a built-in cage provides a fit that contours to your foot for added support as you move from side to side. So run and cut in confidence. You''re the game''s main character, after all.", "current_price": "3,239,000₫3,239,000₫3,239,000₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["The PF edition is designed with a wider fit and optimised for play on outdoor courts.", "Pull tab on heel", "Rubber outsole", "Colour Shown: Sail/Vapour Green/Black", "Style: FZ2473-100", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/u_126ab356-44d8-4a06-89b4-fcdcc8df0245,c_scale,fl_relative,w_1.0,h_1.0,fl_layer_apply/67549078-1f37-4a8e-a27c-0ad5e1d89923/WMNS+JORDAN+HEIR+SERIES+PF.png',99,225.20,'2024-12-22 15:29:13.07118','2024-12-22 15:29:13.07118','basketball','women'),
	 ('1e4c919a-8afd-4a74-9302-f2517b2249a5','Nike G.T. Jump 2 EP','{"title": "", "benefits": ["Lacing directly through the medial and lateral webbing loops adds forefoot support.", "Engineered mesh provides lightweight, breathable comfort and containment.", "Colour Shown: Viotech/Hyper Violet/Bold Berry/Metallic Red Bronze", "Style: DJ9432-501", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"], "description": "How high do you want to fly? Get off the ground quicker in a design that helps you hover and hold your own in the air when the action goes vertical. If you''re a shooter trying to add lift to your jump, a skyscraper hoping to float among the stars or a ground-bound beast trying to beat your opponent to that rebound off the rim, this shoe can add an element of explosiveness to your game. The bounce is unlike anything you''ve felt before and the landing is cushioned, helping you spring back skywards once you hit the ground. With its extra-durable rubber outsole, this version gives you traction for outdoor courts.", "current_price": "5,279,000₫5,279,000₫5,279,000₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["Colour Shown: Viotech/Hyper Violet/Bold Berry/Metallic Red Bronze", "Style: DJ9432-501", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/1c75f88f-dbd1-4019-bc38-daea163d2832/NIKE+AIR+ZOOM+G.T.+JUMP+2+EP.png',84,274.09,'2024-12-22 15:29:13.072104','2024-12-22 15:29:13.072104','basketball','women'),
	 ('e0644025-19de-4dcc-a8b1-e6c21da91f59','Nike G.T. Cut Academy EP','{"title": "", "benefits": ["Colour Shown: Light Wild Mango/Hot Fuchsia/Plum Dust/White", "Style: FB2598-600", "Country/Region of Origin: China"], "description": "Whether you''re playing in the gym, at the park or on your driveway, lace up in the all-new G.T. Cut Academy. Designed to help you create space for step-back jumpers, back-door cuts and other game-changing plays, its sticky multi-court traction helps you stop in an instant and shift gears at will—wherever your next game is calling you. With its extra-durable rubber outsole, this version gives you traction for outdoor courts.", "current_price": "2,649,000₫2,649,000₫2,649,000₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["Colour Shown: Light Wild Mango/Hot Fuchsia/Plum Dust/White", "Style: FB2598-600", "Country/Region of Origin: China"]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/4f95a15d-2920-490b-853d-8ea99fd26954/AIR+ZOOM+G.T.+CUT+ACADEMY+EP.png',70,445.76,'2024-12-22 15:29:13.072904','2024-12-22 15:29:13.072904','basketball','women');
