	 ('27cbac3d-dc6b-43f6-862d-1f17b01ab551','Nike Winflo 11','{"title": "", "benefits": ["A breathable engineered mesh upper", "A Cushlon 3.0 foam midsole with a full-length Nike Air unit", "A rubber Waffle-inspired outsole for reliable traction", "An elastic midfoot band to accommodate a variety of fits and activities", "What''s new? A spacious forefoot, a wider heel and even better breathability.", "Weight: 262g approx. (women''s size 6)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 10mm", "MR-10 Last—Our best, most consistent fit", "Reflective design details", "Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)", "Reflective design details", "Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)", "Colour Shown: Crimson Tint/Hot Punch/Pale Ivory/Dark Raisin", "Style: FJ9510-800", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"], "description": "Responsive cushioning provides a balanced ride for everyday runs. Experience energy return with a combination of Cushlon 3.0 foam and a full-length Nike Air unit in the midsole. Plus, an elastic midfoot band and a spacious forefoot provide an accommodating, comfortable fit.", "current_price": "2,929,000₫2,929,000₫2,929,000₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["A breathable engineered mesh upper", "A Cushlon 3.0 foam midsole with a full-length Nike Air unit", "A rubber Waffle-inspired outsole for reliable traction", "An elastic midfoot band to accommodate a variety of fits and activities", "What''s new? A spacious forefoot, a wider heel and even better breathability.", "Weight: 262g approx. (women''s size 6)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 10mm", "MR-10 Last—Our best, most consistent fit", "Reflective design details", "Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)", "Reflective design details", "Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)", "Colour Shown: Crimson Tint/Hot Punch/Pale Ivory/Dark Raisin", "Style: FJ9510-800", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_prod