rafted for performance and planet, ReactX foam is engineered to reduce its carbon footprint by at least 43% in a pair of midsoles due to reduced manufacturing process energy compared with prior React foam. The carbon footprint of ReactX is based on cradle-to-gate assessment reviewed by PRé Sustainability B.V. and Intertek China. Other midsole components such as airbags, plates or other foam formulations were not considered.", "Reflective design detail on the side of the heel", "Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)", "Weight: approx. 253g (women''s size 5.5)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 9.5mm", "Colour Shown: Black/Cool Grey/Anthracite/Wolf Grey", "Style: FQ0912-001", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/5959662d-01f5-4e66-aa20-87691c90d0b7/W+PEGASUS+TRAIL+5+GTX.png',50,473.17,'2024-12-22 15:34:30.86424','2024-12-22 15:34:30.86424','running','women'),
	 ('d86e039b-f198-4f8e-af5f-f5df90a4751b','Nike Zegama 2','{"title": "", "benefits": ["Ankle gaiter helps limit trail debris.", "Overlays stretch across the toe for extra durability.", "Weight: 264g approx. (Women''s UK 5.5)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 4mm", "Reflective design details", "Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)", "Colour Shown: Jade Horizon/Cyber/Crimson Tint/Sail", "Style: FD5191-300", "Country/Region of Origin: China"], "description": "Up the mountain, through the woods, to the top of the trail you can go. Equipped with an ultra-responsive ZoomX foam midsole, the Zegama 2 is designed to conquer steep ridges, jagged rocks and races from trailhead to tip. Optimal cushioning complements a rugged outsole made for your trail running journey.", "current_price": "5,279,000₫5,279,000₫5,279,000₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["Weight: 264g approx. (Women''s UK 5.5)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 4mm", "Reflective design details", "Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)", "Colour Shown: Jade Horizon/Cyber/Crimson Tint/Sail", "Style: FD5191-300", "Country/Region of Origin: China"]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/3232102b-23d9-4857-a095-7a9e3d3dc507/W+NIKE+ZOOMX+ZEGAMA+TRAIL+2.png',99,307.74,'2024-12-22 15:34:30.865228','2024-12-22 15:34:30.865228','running','women'),
	 ('46d69545-b8a5-45cb-86fd-44169de3f58c','Nike InfinityRN 4','{"title": "", "benefits": ["The updated Flyknit upper and a water-resistant membrane help keep you dry", "New ReactX foam in the midsole for extra cushioning", "A Waffle outsole for durable traction on the roads", "An ultra-comfortable collar and tongue for a soft, snug fit", "What''s new? New ReactX cushioning for even more comfort, and a revamped upper and wider toe box.", "Weight: Approx. 281g (women''s size 6)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 9mm", "Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)", "Waffle outsole provides durable traction.", "Flyknit tongue is adjustable and plush.", "Foam collar is soft and supportive to the touch.", "Increased rubber at the outsole gives traction and durability.", "Weight: 281g (women''s size 5.5)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 9mm", "Colour Shown: Hot Punch/Black/Aster Pink/Light Iron Ore", "Style: DR2670-602", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"], "description": "Maximum cushioning provides elevated comfort for everyday runs. Experience a soft, rocker-shaped platform made with new ReactX foam underfoot, and an ultra-comfortable collar and tongue for a snug feel. Plus, a water-resistant membrane was added to this version to help keep you dry.", "current_price": "4,699,000₫4,699,000₫4,699,000₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["The updated Flyknit upper and a water-resistant membrane help keep you dry", "New ReactX foam in the midsole for extra cushioning", "A Waffle outsole for durable traction on the roads", "An ultra-comfortable collar and tongue for a soft, snug fit", "What''s new? New ReactX cushioning for even more comfort, and a revamped upper and wider toe box.", "Weight: Approx. 281g (women''s size 6)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 9mm", "Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)", "Waffle outsole provides durable traction.", "Flyknit tongue is adjustable and plush.", "Foam collar is soft and supportive to the touch.", "Increased rubber at the outsole gives traction and durability.", "Weight: 281g (women''s size 5.5)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 9mm", "Colour Shown: Hot Punch/Black/Aster Pink/Light Iron Ore", "Style: DR2670-602", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/e706c836-e164-4af3-9656-7a61dedf5e37/W+NIKE+REACTX+INFINITY+RUN+4.png',75,471.31,'2024-12-22 15:34:30.86599','2024-12-22 15:34:30.86599','running','women'),
	 ('028ef329-1996-4718-9830-e8365656ec40','Nike Pegasus Plus','{"title": "", "benefits": ["The Flyknit upper has perforations to help reduce the weight of the shoe and make it more breathable.", "The ZoomX foam midsole offers springy cushioning.", "High-abrasion rubber on the outsole provides traction.", "The midfoot band helps keep you contained.", "Weight: approx. 205g (women''s size 5.5)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 10mm", "Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)", "Colour Shown: Black/Anthracite/White/Pure Platinum", "Style: FQ7261-002", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"], "description": "Take responsive cushioning to the next level with the Pegasus Plus. It energises your ride with full-length, super-light ZoomX foam to give you a high level of energy return for everyday runs. And a stretchy Flyknit upper contours to your foot for a seamless fit.", "current_price": "5,279,000₫5,279,000₫5,279,000₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["Weight: approx. 205g (women''s size 5.5)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 10mm", "Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)", "Colour Shown: Black/Anthracite/White/Pure Platinum", "Style: FQ7261-002", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/a25c35a8-d82b-4759-bfc6-cfb9fd68fe2d/W+PEGASUS+PLUS.png',52,235.93,'2024-12-22 15:34:30.867122','2024-12-22 15:34:30.867122','running','women'),
	 ('f15c7ca9-d11a-46b5-b992-72b0c84807f0','Nike Pegasus EasyOn Blueprint','{"title": "", "benefits": ["The engineered toggle gives you an adjustable fit.", "Upgraded breathable engineered mesh upper", "ReactX foam midsole surrounds forefoot and heel Air Zoom units for an energised ride.", "A signature Waffle-inspired rubber outsole for traction and flexibility.", "A plush collar, tongue and sockliner for a secure and comfortable fit.", "What''s new? All-new ReactX foam midsole is 13% more responsive than previous React technology.", "Crafted for performance and planet, ReactX foam is engineered to reduce its carbon footprint by at least 43% in a pair of midsoles due to reduced manufacturing process energy compared with prior React foam. The carbon footprint of ReactX is based on cradle-to-gate assessment reviewed by PRé Sustainability B.V. and Intertek China. Other midsole components such as airbags, plates or other foam formulations were not considered.", "Weight: 264g approx. (women''s size 5.5)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 9mm", "Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)", "Colour Shown: Multi-Colour/Multi-Colour", "Style: HM0375-900", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"], "description": "Responsive cushioning in the Pegasus provides an energised ride for everyday road running. Experience lighter-weight energy return with dual Air Zoom units and a ReactX foam midsole. Plus, improved engineered mesh on the upper decreases weight and increases breathability.", "current_price": "3,829,000₫3,829,000₫3,829,000₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["The engineered toggle gives you an adjustable fit.", "Upgraded breathable engineered mesh upper", "ReactX foam midsole surrounds forefoot and heel Air Zoom units for an energised ride.", "A signature Waffle-inspired rubber outsole for traction and flexibility.", "A plush collar, tongue and sockliner for a secure and comfortable fit.", "What''s new? All-new ReactX foam midsole is 13% more responsive than previous React technology.", "Crafted for performance and planet, ReactX foam is engineered to reduce its carbon footprint by at least 43% in a pair of midsoles due to reduced manufacturing process energy compared with prior React foam. The carbon footprint of ReactX is based on cradle-to-gate assessment reviewed by PRé Sustainability B.V. and Intertek China. Other midsole components such as airbags, plates or other foam formulations were not considered.", "Weight: 264g approx. (women''s size 5.5)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 9mm", "Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)", "Colour Shown: Multi-Colour/Multi-Colour", "Style: HM0375-900", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/8e64c5b2-7910-4b8a-8660-e31b907a83d1/W+PEGASUS+EASYON+FP.png',59,222.97,'2024-12-22 15:34:30.868373','2024-12-22 15:34:30.868373','running','women'),
	 ('22300173-4abc-4f80-8a46-0d6bb844d03f','Nike Invincible 3 By You','{"title": "", "benefits": null, "description": "", "current_price": "", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": null}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/d40cdd96-7308-4cbe-8563-647422ecc506/W+ZOOMX+INVINCIBLE+RUN+3+NBY.png',72,332.71,'2024-12-22 15:34:30.921112','2024-12-22 15:34:30.921112','running','women'),
	 ('08c7f877-ff64-47c7-a5c2-bf12c9d1cdc9','Nike Pegasus Trail 5 By You','{"title": "", "benefits": null, "description": "", "current_price": "", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": null}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/7be6af90-14f4-40ab-bf80-977adf52cd46/W+PEGASUS+TRAIL+5+NBY.png',52,206.85,'2024-12-22 15:34:30.921758','2024-12-22 15:34:30.921758','running','women'),
	 ('57290138-3e3d-4be3-ace7-a14e2da61213','Nike InfinityRN 4','{"title": "", "benefits": ["The updated Flyknit upper and a water-resistant membrane help keep you dry", "New ReactX foam in the midsole for extra cushioning", "A Waffle outsole for durable traction on the roads", "An ultra-comfortable collar and tongue for a soft, snug fit", "What''s new? New ReactX cushioning for even more comfort, and a revamped upper and wider toe box.", "Waffle outsole provides durable traction.", "Flyknit tongue is adjustable and plush.", "Foam collar is soft and supportive to the touch.", "Increased rubber at the outsole gives traction and durability.", "Weight: approx. 281g (women''s size 5.5)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 9mm", "Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)", "Colour Shown: Black/Dark Grey/White", "Style: FN0880-001", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"], "description": "Maximum cushioning provides elevated comfort for everyday runs. Experience a soft, rocker-shaped platform made with new ReactX foam underfoot, and an ultra-comfortable collar and tongue for a snug feel. Plus, a water-resistant membrane was added to this version to help keep you dry.", "current_price": "4,699,000₫4,699,000₫4,699,000₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["Weight: approx. 281g (women''s size 5.5)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 9mm", "Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)", "Colour Shown: Black/Dark Grey/White", "Style: FN0880-001", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/056c3a04-b6bb-4523-b274-f2683e9d40f2/W+NIKE+REACTX+INFINITY+RUN+4+W.png',85,374.96,'2024-12-22 15:34:30.869529','2024-12-22 15:34:30.869529','running','women'),
	 ('578203fe-38da-4a3b-98b4-081bb48b8181','Nike Pegasus Trail 5','{"title": "", "benefits": ["Weight: 243 grams approx. (women''s UK 6)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 9.5mm", "Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)", "Colour Shown: Black/Anthracite/Wolf Grey/White", "Style: DV3865-001", "Country/Region of Origin: China"], "description": "Spread your wings and see what nature brings as you chase earthy paths in the Peg Trail 5. Now equipped with an ultra-responsive ReactX foam midsole, this shoe is a true dual threat raring to cross the divide between dirt and drives.", "current_price": "4,109,000₫4,109,000₫4,109,000₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["Weight: 243 grams approx. (women''s UK 6)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 9.5mm", "Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)", "Colour Shown: Black/Anthracite/Wolf Grey/White", "Style: DV3865-001", "Country/Region of Origin: China"]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/5c2f0db0-9338-48ed-9112-bbe60ee32bcf/W+NIKE+REACTX+PEGASUS+TRAIL+5.png',84,320.88,'2024-12-22 15:34:30.870783','2024-12-22 15:34:30.870783','running','women');
INSERT INTO public."PRODUCT" ("PRODUCT_ID","PRODUCT_NAME","PRODUCT_DESCRIPTION","PRODUCT_IMAGE","PRODUCT_QUANTITY","PRODUCT_PRICE","CREATED_AT","UPDATED_AT","PRODUCT_CATEGORY","GENDER") VALUES
	 ('8529ed77-059f-4082-a68d-d860d00380e6','Nike Motiva','{"title": "", "benefits": ["Super-high cushioning", "Moderate stability", "Moderate flexibility", "Soft foam collar", "Widened forefoot, arch and toe box", "Durable outsole pattern for traction", "Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)", "The soft foam waterfall collar hugs around the ankle and heel for comfort.", "The 1/2 inner sleeve helps you get the shoe on and off with ease. It also helps reduce rubbing during your workout.", "The widened forefoot, arch and toe box provide a comfortable fit when you''re on the go.", "Colour Shown: Photon Dust/Light Smoke Grey/Metallic Pewter/Photon Dust", "Style: DV1238-010", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"], "description": "Designed for walking in ultimate comfort, the Nike Motiva provides our highest level of cushioning. A tall foam stack is combined with our Comfortgroove innovation on the outsole to absorb the bumps along the way. And its exaggerated rocker helps propel you forwards.", "current_price": "3,239,000₫3,239,000₫3,239,000₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["Super-high cushioning", "Moderate stability", "Moderate flexibility", "Soft foam collar", "Widened forefoot, arch and toe box", "Durable outsole pattern for traction", "Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)", "The soft foam waterfall collar hugs around the ankle and heel for comfort.", "The 1/2 inner sleeve helps you get the shoe on and off with ease. It also helps reduce rubbing during your workout.", "The widened forefoot, arch and toe box provide a comfortable fit when you''re on the go.", "Colour Shown: Photon Dust/Light Smoke Grey/Metallic Pewter/Photon Dust", "Style: DV1238-010", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/d8952a3c-94ef-47db-a237-1240961175ee/WMNS+NIKE+MOTIVA.png',87,433.98,'2024-12-22 15:34:30.871722','2024-12-22 15:34:30.871722','running','women'),
	 ('2a20abb8-1d91-4059-9f61-835c79ae2932','Nike Vaporfly 3 Electric','{"title": "", "benefits": ["Light padding on the tongue helps reduce lace pressure at the top of your foot.", "A Waffle outsole pattern with perforations saves weight and delivers multi-surface traction in various weather conditions.", "Offset heel seam helps reduce friction in the heel area.", "Weight: approx. 165g (women''s UK 5.5)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 8mm", "Wider toe area for a roomier fit", "Internal foam pod on the heel for extra cushioning", "Colour Shown: Multi-Colour/Multi-Colour", "Style: FN7674-900", "Country/Region of Origin: China"], "description": "Catch ''em if you can. Giving you race-day speed to conquer any distance, the Nike Vaporfly 3 is made for those who can''t turn down the thrill of the pursuit. We reworked the leader of the super shoe pack and tuned the engine underneath to help you chase personal bests from a 10K to marathon. From elite runners to those new to racing, this versatile road-racing shoe is for those who see speed as a gateway to more miles and more seemingly uncatchable highs.", "current_price": "6,919,000₫6,919,000₫6,919,000₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["Weight: approx. 165g (women''s UK 5.5)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 8mm", "Wider toe area for a roomier fit", "Internal foam pod on the heel for extra cushioning", "Colour Shown: Multi-Colour/Multi-Colour", "Style: FN7674-900", "Country/Region of Origin: China"]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/467c9f92-2ced-40d1-b663-06b9089c1436/W+ZOOMX+VAPORFLY+NEXT%25+3+OLY.png',87,440.47,'2024-12-22 15:34:30.872641','2024-12-22 15:34:30.872641','running','women'),
	 ('37e1e0eb-6151-49c5-885e-a938cc9d2c94','Nike Invincible 3 Electric','{"title": "", "benefits": ["A breathable Flyknit upper for a secure fit without bulk", "The high and wide ZoomX foam midsole cushions on impact", "A Waffle outsole for durable traction", "Extra cushioning around contact points at the heel and tongue", "What''s new? A wider and taller ZoomX foam midsole for maximum comfort and sleek all-round design updates.", "Weight: approx. 258g (women''s size 5.5)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 9mm", "Colour Shown: Multi-Colour/Multi-Colour", "Style: FN7676-900", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"], "description": "Maximum cushioning provides our most comfortable ride for everyday runs. Experience a breathable Flyknit upper and the robust platform of lightweight ZoomX foam that softens impact. Plus, the midsole of this model is wider and taller than the last for even more cushioned comfort.", "current_price": "5,589,000₫5,589,000₫5,589,000₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["A breathable Flyknit upper for a secure fit without bulk", "The high and wide ZoomX foam midsole cushions on impact", "A Waffle outsole for durable traction", "Extra cushioning around contact points at the heel and tongue", "What''s new? A wider and taller ZoomX foam midsole for maximum comfort and sleek all-round design updates.", "Weight: approx. 258g (women''s size 5.5)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 9mm", "Colour Shown: Multi-Colour/Multi-Colour", "Style: FN7676-900", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/49c0a1b6-7111-46e1-9f33-ae1d41908e02/W+ZOOMX+INVINCIBLE+RN+FK+3+OLY.png',95,322.54,'2024-12-22 15:34:30.873582','2024-12-22 15:34:30.873582','running','women'),
	 ('b71eab76-be93-471b-8e6d-1cf619e129f8','Nike Invincible 3 By You','{"title": "", "benefits": null, "description": "", "current_price": "", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": null}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/a7708b72-3ca7-47bb-aaf7-a16ea418791d/W+ZOOMX+INVINCIBLE+RUN+3+NBY.png',82,458.35,'2024-12-22 15:34:30.922409','2024-12-22 15:34:30.922409','running','women'),
	 ('b0c449d4-07f0-46b6-b159-812261dd914f','Nike Motiva','{"title": "", "benefits": ["Super-high cushioning", "Moderate stability", "Moderate flexibility", "Soft foam collar", "Widened forefoot, arch and toe box", "Durable outsole pattern for traction", "Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)", "The soft foam waterfall collar hugs around the ankle and heel for comfort.", "The 1/2 inner sleeve helps you get the shoe on and off with ease. It also helps reduce rubbing during your workout.", "The widened forefoot, arch and toe box provide a comfortable fit when you''re on the go.", "Colour Shown: Hot Punch/Volt/Aster Pink/Denim Turquoise", "Style: DV1238-602", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"], "description": "Designed for walking in ultimate comfort, the Nike Motiva provides our highest level of cushioning. A tall foam stack is combined with our Comfortgroove innovation on the outsole to absorb the bumps along the way. And its exaggerated rocker helps propel you forwards.", "current_price": "3,239,000₫3,239,000₫3,239,000₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["Super-high cushioning", "Moderate stability", "Moderate flexibility", "Soft foam collar", "Widened forefoot, arch and toe box", "Durable outsole pattern for traction", "Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)", "The soft foam waterfall collar hugs around the ankle and heel for comfort.", "The 1/2 inner sleeve helps you get the shoe on and off with ease. It also helps reduce rubbing during your workout.", "The widened forefoot, arch and toe box provide a comfortable fit when you''re on the go.", "Colour Shown: Hot Punch/Volt/Aster Pink/Denim Turquoise", "Style: DV1238-602", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/06c2b471-7421-42f5-8f85-a74678ff86e4/WMNS+NIKE+MOTIVA.png',63,407.76,'2024-12-22 15:34:30.874735','2024-12-22 15:34:30.874735','running','women'),
	 ('7af3d2a8-0cb7-44a3-8406-f5ffb4a0ecc4','Nike Streakfly','{"title": "", "benefits": ["Partially integrated tongue delivers a secure fit.", "Rubber outsole provides traction.", "Weight: Approx. 185g (men''s size 9)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 6mm", "Colour Shown: Volt/Bright Crimson/Volt/Black", "Style: DJ6566-700", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"], "description": "Our lightest racing shoe, the Nike Streakfly is all about the speed you need to take on the competition in a mile, 5K or 10K race. Low profile with sleek details, it feels like it disappears on your foot to help you better connect with the road on the way to your personal best.", "current_price": "4,699,000₫4,699,000₫4,699,000₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["Weight: Approx. 185g (men''s size 9)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 6mm", "Colour Shown: Volt/Bright Crimson/Volt/Black", "Style: DJ6566-700", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/1bf6f4d9-0b4d-4477-9406-9f6c01250096/NIKE+ZOOMX+STREAKFLY.png',67,330.69,'2024-12-22 15:34:30.875804','2024-12-22 15:34:30.875804','running','women'),
	 ('7d9706eb-cd8d-461e-bde7-e1b5658a8ea6','Nike InfinityRN 4','{"title": "", "benefits": ["The updated Flyknit upper and a water-resistant membrane help keep you dry", "New ReactX foam in the midsole for extra cushioning", "A Waffle outsole for durable traction on the roads", "An ultra-comfortable collar and tongue for a soft, snug fit", "What''s new? New ReactX cushioning for even more comfort, and a revamped upper and wider toe box.", "Weight: Approx. 281g (women''s size 6)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 9mm", "Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)", "Waffle outsole provides durable traction.", "Flyknit tongue is adjustable and plush.", "Foam collar is soft and supportive to the touch.", "Increased rubber at the outsole gives traction and durability.", "Weight: 281g (women''s size 5.5)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 9mm", "Colour Shown: Light Smoke Grey/Barely Grape/Violet Mist/Summit White", "Style: DR2670-012", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"], "description": "Maximum cushioning provides elevated comfort for everyday runs. Experience a soft, rocker-shaped platform made with new ReactX foam underfoot, and an ultra-comfortable collar and tongue for a snug feel. Plus, a water-resistant membrane was added to this version to help keep you dry.", "current_price": "4,699,000₫4,699,000₫4,699,000₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["The updated Flyknit upper and a water-resistant membrane help keep you dry", "New ReactX foam in the midsole for extra cushioning", "A Waffle outsole for durable traction on the roads", "An ultra-comfortable collar and tongue for a soft, snug fit", "What''s new? New ReactX cushioning for even more comfort, and a revamped upper and wider toe box.", "Weight: Approx. 281g (women''s size 6)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 9mm", "Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)", "Waffle outsole provides durable traction.", "Flyknit tongue is adjustable and plush.", "Foam collar is soft and supportive to the touch.", "Increased rubber at the outsole gives traction and durability.", "Weight: 281g (women''s size 5.5)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 9mm", "Colour Shown: Light Smoke Grey/Barely Grape/Violet Mist/Summit White", "Style: DR2670-012", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/492e61d7-3e4a-47c9-b58c-2fd41a18b347/W+NIKE+REACTX+INFINITY+RUN+4.png',52,331.70,'2024-12-22 15:34:30.876681','2024-12-22 15:34:30.876681','running','women'),
	 ('4550cf9d-cde9-4f92-8ad9-828648536669','Nike Journey Run','{"title": "", "benefits": ["Engineered mesh helps your feet feel secure.", "Extra cushioning in the heel and soft touch points in the tongue and collar add comfort.", "The rubber outsole provides traction for your miles.", "Reflective design details", "Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)", "Colour Shown: Photon Dust/Cool Grey/Light Smoke Grey/Metallic Pewter", "Style: FJ7765-006", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"], "description": "Enjoy every step, route and jaunt in the Nike Journey Run. It''ll have you striding and smiling on punishing pavements, thanks to extra-high foam stacks and super-soft cushioning. It''s so comfy that you''ll already be looking forward to lacing ''em up again.", "current_price": "2,649,000₫2,649,000₫2,649,000₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["Reflective design details", "Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)", "Colour Shown: Photon Dust/Cool Grey/Light Smoke Grey/Metallic Pewter", "Style: FJ7765-006", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/554482c2-18e8-4226-8b42-5e669b30c32c/W+NIKE+JOURNEY+RUN.png',80,498.49,'2024-12-22 15:34:30.877535','2024-12-22 15:34:30.877535','running','women'),
	 ('7d5232e2-564a-4e5a-af72-4f44b4c3651d','Nike Invincible 3','{"title": "", "benefits": ["A breathable Flyknit upper for a secure fit without bulk", "The high and wide ZoomX foam midsole cushions on impact", "A Waffle outsole for durable traction", "Extra cushioning around contact points at the heel and tongue", "What''s new? A wider and taller ZoomX foam midsole for maximum comfort and sleek all-round design updates.", "Weight: Approx. 258g (women''s size 6)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 9mm", "Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)", "Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)", "Weight: 258g (women''s size 5.5)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 9mm", "As a result of a design update, the heel text of the product you purchase may be different from the heel text depicted on Nike.com. In case of any questions, please contact Nike consumer service.", "Colour Shown: Photon Dust/Psychic Blue/Sail/Light Smoke Grey", "Style: DR2660-010", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"], "description": "Maximum cushioning provides our most comfortable ride for everyday runs. Experience a breathable Flyknit upper and the robust platform of lightweight ZoomX foam that softens impact. Plus, the midsole of this model is wider and taller than the last for even more cushioned comfort.", "current_price": "5,279,000₫5,279,000₫5,279,000₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["A breathable Flyknit upper for a secure fit without bulk", "The high and wide ZoomX foam midsole cushions on impact", "A Waffle outsole for durable traction", "Extra cushioning around contact points at the heel and tongue", "What''s new? A wider and taller ZoomX foam midsole for maximum comfort and sleek all-round design updates.", "Weight: Approx. 258g (women''s size 6)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 9mm", "Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)", "Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)", "Weight: 258g (women''s size 5.5)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 9mm", "As a result of a design update, the heel text of the product you purchase may be different from the heel text depicted on Nike.com. In case of any questions, please contact Nike consumer service.", "Colour Shown: Photon Dust/Psychic Blue/Sail/Light Smoke Grey", "Style: DR2660-010", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/772341cc-ed36-4eed-bb9e-0da296178b4b/WMNS+ZOOMX+INVINCIBLE+RUN+FK+3.png',70,222.37,'2024-12-22 15:34:30.878495','2024-12-22 15:34:30.878495','running','women'),
	 ('fecefc51-089c-41ae-9bf3-1e69c0d1b69b','Nike Interact Run','{"title": "", "benefits": ["We created the rubber outsole using runner-informed data for traction where you need it.", "The overlays on the toe offer durability.", "Colour Shown: Light Smoke Grey/Psychic Blue/Summit White/Echo Pink", "Style: FD2292-012", "Country/Region of Origin: Indonesia"], "description": "Can you see the future? Fast-forward your footsteps in the cutting-edge Nike Interact Run. It''s set up with all the running goodness you need: a lightweight Flyknit upper, soft foam midsole and comfort where it counts. Scan the QR code on the tongue with your phone, and check out our online introduction to the Nike Interact Run''s ins and outs.", "current_price": "2,349,000₫2,349,000₫2,349,000₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["Colour Shown: Light Smoke Grey/Psychic Blue/Summit White/Echo Pink", "Style: FD2292-012", "Country/Region of Origin: Indonesia"]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/9453b072-b9cd-4fe2-807d-3ebaa0643d1c/W+NIKE+INTERACT+RUN.png',99,257.39,'2024-12-22 15:34:30.87946','2024-12-22 15:34:30.87946','running','women');
