	 ('cc41a26a-70cc-4e91-97be-666c4810df7c','Nike Vomero 17','{"title": "", "benefits": ["A new engineered mesh upper for soft breathability", "A dual-density midsole with ZoomX foam stacked on top of Cushlon 3.0 foam for a comfortable ride", "A redesigned Waffle-inspired outsole with break points for a smooth, flexible stride", "A plush tongue and lining for a comfortably snug feel", "What''s new? The new stacked foam midsole with premium ZoomX on top of Cushlon 3.0 foam to amplify cushioned comfort.", "Weight: approx. 241g (women''s size 5.5)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 10mm", "MR-10 Last—Our best, most consistent fit", "Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)", "High-abrasion rubber with lugs on the outsole gives you durable traction.", "Flexible outsole helps improve your heel-to-toe transition.", "Weight: 240.9g approx. (women''s size 5.5)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 10mm", "Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)", "Colour Shown: Black/Anthracite/White", "Style: FB8502-001", "Country/Region of Origin: China"], "description": "Maximum cushioning provides a comfortable ride for everyday runs. Experience enhanced comfort in this latest version, with a dual-density midsole made with a combination of ZoomX underfoot and Cushlon 3.0 foam throughout. Plus, a new engineered mesh upper offers more breathability.", "current_price": "4,699,000₫4,699,000₫4,699,000₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["A new engineered mesh upper for soft breathability", "A dual-density midsole with ZoomX foam stacked on top of Cushlon 3.0 foam for a comfortable ride", "A redesigned Waffle-inspired outsole with break points for a smooth, flexible stride", "A plush tongue and lining for a comfortably snug feel", "What''s new? The new stacked foam midsole with premium ZoomX on top of Cushlon 3.0 foam to amplify cushioned comfort.", "Weight: approx. 241g (women''s size 5.5)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 10mm", "MR-10 Last—Our best, most consistent fit", "Not intended for