	 ('1f81c19c-d794-468a-b936-5179b20de3bb','Nike Motiva','{"title": "", "benefits": ["Super-high cushioning", "Moderate stability", "Moderate flexibility", "Soft foam collar", "Widened forefoot, arch and toe box", "Durable outsole pattern for traction", "Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)", "The soft foam waterfall collar hugs around the ankle and heel for comfort.", "The 1/2 inner sleeve helps you get the shoe on and off with ease. It also helps reduce rubbing during your workout.", "The widened forefoot, arch and toe box provide a comfortable fit when you''re on the go.", "Colour Shown: Sail/White/Phantom/Sail", "Style: DV1238-102", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"], "description": "Designed for walking in ultimate comfort, the Nike Motiva provides our highest level of cushioning. A tall foam stack is combined with our Comfortgroove innovation on the outsole to absorb the bumps along the way. And its exaggerated rocker helps propel you forwards.", "current_price": "2,591,199₫2,591,199₫2,591,199₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["Super-high cushioning", "Moderate stability", "Moderate flexibility", "Soft foam collar", "Widened forefoot, arch and toe box", "Durable outsole pattern for traction", "Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)", "The soft foam waterfall collar hugs around the ankle and heel for comfort.", "The 1/2 inner sleeve helps you get the shoe on and off with ease. It also helps reduce rubbing during your workout.", "The widened forefoot, arch and toe box provide a comfortable fit when you''re on the go.", "Colour Shown: Sail/White/Phantom/Sail", "Style: DV1238-102", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/06af619f-3ca9-4b47-a7ec-1484eac4cf0d/WMNS+NIKE+MOTIVA.png',73,283.00,'2024-12-22 15:34:30.959028','2024-12-22 15:34:30.959028','running','women'),
