it", "Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)", "High-abrasion rubber with lugs on the outsole gives you durable traction.", "Flexible outsole helps improve your heel-to-toe transition.", "Weight: 240.9g approx. (women''s size 5.5)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 10mm", "Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)", "Colour Shown: Glacier Blue/Barely Green/Vapour Green/Black", "Style: FB8502-402", "Country/Region of Origin: China"]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/bafd1bf5-3c99-4b33-b8b6-1b762c0a783e/W+NIKE+VOMERO+17.png',84,333.49,'2024-12-22 15:34:30.959856','2024-12-22 15:34:30.959856','running','women'),
	 ('99c2fea6-900c-458a-825b-d64d8cb9daa6','Nike Streakfly','{"title": "", "benefits": ["Partially integrated tongue delivers a secure fit.", "Rubber outsole provides traction.", "Weight: Approx. 185g (men''s size 9)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 6mm", "Colour Shown: Black/White/Sail/Metallic Gold Grain", "Style: DJ6566-001", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"], "description": "Our lightest racing shoe, the Nike Streakfly is all about the speed you need to take on the competition in a mile, 5K or 10K race. Low profile with sleek details, it feels like it disappears on your foot to help you better connect with the road on the way to your personal best.", "current_price": "3,759,199₫3,759,199₫3,759,199₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["Weight: Approx. 185g (men''s size 9)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 6mm", "Colour Shown: Black/White/Sail/Metallic Gold Grain", "Style: DJ6566-001", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/84c1e0d5-ac53-4d7b-8991-f5d9a9cb3465/NIKE+ZOOMX+STREAKFLY.png',50,265.41,'2024-12-22 15:34:30.96069','2024-12-22 15:34:30.96069','running','women'),
	 ('13784a39-41ec-4978-9c19-436cf35ca8c6','Nike InfinityRN 4','{"title": "", "benefits": ["The updated Flyknit upper and a water-resistant membrane help keep you dry", "New ReactX foam in the midsole for extra cushioning", "A Waffle outsole for durable traction on the roads", "An ultra-comfortable collar and tongue for a soft, snug fit", "What''s new? New ReactX cushioning for even more comfort, and a revamped upper and wider toe box.", "Weight: Approx. 281g (women''s size 6)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 9mm", "Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)", "Waffle outsole provides durable traction.", "Flyknit tongue is adjustable and plush.", "Foam collar is soft and supportive to the touch.", "Increased rubber at the outsole gives traction and durability.", "Weight: 281g (women''s size 5.5)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 9mm", "Colour Shown: Volt/Black/Barely Volt", "Style: DR2670-700", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"], "description": "Maximum cushioning provides elevated comfort for everyday runs. Experience a soft, rocker-shaped platform made with new ReactX foam underfoot, and an ultra-comfortable collar and tongue for a snug feel. Plus, a water-resistant membrane was added to this version to help keep you dry.", "current_price": "3,759,199₫3,759,199₫3,759,199₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["The updated Flyknit upper and a water-resistant membrane help keep you dry", "New ReactX foam in the midsole for extra cushioning", "A Waffle outsole for durable traction on the roads", "An ultra-comfortable collar and tongue for a soft, snug fit", "What''s new? New ReactX cushioning for even more comfort, and a revamped upper and wider toe box.", "Weight: Approx. 281g (women''s size 6)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 9mm", "Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)", "Waffle outsole provides durable traction.", "Flyknit tongue is adjustable and plush.", "Foam collar is soft and supportive to the touch.", "Increased rubber at the outsole gives traction 