	 ('8f1cd34e-ad75-4505-a6eb-d833e09e8224','Nike Invincible 3','{"title": "", "benefits": ["A breathable Flyknit upper for a secure fit without bulk", "The high and wide ZoomX foam midsole cushions on impact", "A Waffle outsole for durable traction", "Extra cushioning around contact points at the heel and tongue", "What''s new? A wider and taller ZoomX foam midsole for maximum comfort and sleek all-round design updates.", "Weight: Approx. 258g (women''s size 6)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 9mm", "Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)", "Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)", "Weight: 258g (women''s size 5.5)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 9mm", "As a result of a design update, the heel text of the product you purchase may be different from the heel text depicted on Nike.com. In case of any questions, please contact Nike consumer service.", "Colour Shown: Pink Foam/Pearl Pink/Pink Glow/White", "Style: DR2660-601", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"], "description": "Maximum cushioning provides our most comfortable ride for everyday runs. Experience a breathable Flyknit upper and the robust platform of lightweight ZoomX foam that softens impact. Plus, the midsole of this model is wider and taller than the last for even more cushioned comfort.", "current_price": "4,223,199₫4,223,199₫4,223,199₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["A breathable Flyknit upper for a secure fit without bulk", "The high and wide ZoomX foam midsole cushions on impact", "A Waffle outsole for durable traction", "Extra cushioning around contact points at the heel and tongue", "What''s new? A wider and taller ZoomX foam midsole for maximum comfort and sleek all-round design updates.", "Weight: Approx. 258g (women''s size 6)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 9mm", "Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)", "Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)", "Weight: 258g (women''s size 5.5)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 9mm", "As a result of a design upda