	 ('739cf9dc-15ef-49b6-b6d3-3bc41a96d774','Nike Winflo 10','{"title": "", "benefits": ["A breathable engineered mesh upper", "Encapsulated Nike Air cushioning for a springy feel", "A rubber Waffle-inspired outsole for reliable traction", "An elastic midfoot band to accommodate a variety of fits and activities", "What''s new? A revamped toe box and added cushioning on the collar and tongue for a better fit.", "Weight: Approx. 242g (women''s size 6)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 10mm", "MR-10 Last—Our best, most consistent fit", "Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)", "Engineered mesh—stronger and more flexible than ordinary mesh—improves hand feel and comfort while maintaining a lightweight, breathable feel.", "Overlays at the toe add a layer of durability.", "The tongue is connected to the upper''s inner lining for a secure feel.", "Weight: 242g (women''s size 5.5)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 10mm", "Colour Shown: Platinum Violet/White/Photon Dust/Pacific Moss", "Style: DV4023-010", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"], "description": "The responsive cushioning provides a springy ride for everyday runs. Experience energy return with encapsulated Nike Air cushioning and an accommodating fit with an elastic midfoot band. Plus, a revamped toe box offers improved comfort and fit.", "current_price": "2,050,299₫2,050,299₫2,050,299₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["A breathable engineered mesh upper", "Encapsulated Nike Air cushioning for a springy feel", "A rubber Waffle-inspired outsole for reliable traction", "An elastic midfoot band to accommodate a variety of fits and activities", "What''s new? A revamped toe box and added cushioning on the collar and tongue for a better fit.", "Weight: Approx. 242g (women''s size 6)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 10mm", "MR-10 Last—Our best, most consistent fit", "Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)", "Engineered mesh—stronger and more flexible than ordinary mesh—improves hand feel and comfort while ma