	 ('a1225e92-3ec3-46bb-9b44-46b22834aab7','Nike InfinityRN 4','{"title": "", "benefits": ["The updated Flyknit upper and a water-resistant membrane help keep you dry", "New ReactX foam in the midsole for extra cushioning", "A Waffle outsole for durable traction on the roads", "An ultra-comfortable collar and tongue for a soft, snug fit", "What''s new? New ReactX cushioning for even more comfort, and a revamped upper and wider toe box.", "Weight: Approx. 281g (women''s size 6)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 9mm", "Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)", "Waffle outsole provides durable traction.", "Flyknit tongue is adjustable and plush.", "Foam collar is soft and supportive to the touch.", "Increased rubber at the outsole gives traction and durability.", "Weight: 281g (women''s size 5.5)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 9mm", "Colour Shown: Black/White/Black", "Style: DR2670-003", "Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"], "description": "Maximum cushioning provides elevated comfort for everyday runs. Experience a soft, rocker-shaped platform made with new ReactX foam underfoot, and an ultra-comfortable collar and tongue for a snug feel. Plus, a water-resistant membrane was added to this version to help keep you dry.", "current_price": "3,759,199₫3,759,199₫3,759,199₫", "reason_to_buy": "", "product_details": ["The updated Flyknit upper and a water-resistant membrane help keep you dry", "New ReactX foam in the midsole for extra cushioning", "A Waffle outsole for durable traction on the roads", "An ultra-comfortable collar and tongue for a soft, snug fit", "What''s new? New ReactX cushioning for even more comfort, and a revamped upper and wider toe box.", "Weight: Approx. 281g (women''s size 6)", "Heel-to-toe drop: 9mm", "Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)", "Waffle outsole provides durable traction.", "Flyknit tongue is adjustable and plush.", "Foam collar is soft and supportive to the touch.", "Increased rubber at the outsole gives traction and d